# Documentation
The main entry point for translation is the script torust.py. This script takes the following arguments:
--langauge <c,cpp,go>: (required) 
--benchmark-dir <benchmark/some/benchmark>: (required) The path to the directory containing the benchmark. See documentation below for the required contents of this directory.
--replay-cache: (optional)
--aws-profile <some-aws-profile>: (optional)

## Benchmark Directory
The benchmark directory expects a specific format for it's contents. Assuming you call torust.py as follows:

python3 torust.py --language c --benchmark-dir benchmark/c_transcoder/BASIC_AND_EXTENDED_EUCLIDEAN_ALGORITHMS

The torust.py scripts expects a single file benchmark/c_transcoder/BASIC_AND_EXTENDED_EUCLIDEAN_ALGORITHMS/BASIC_AND_EXTENDED_EUCLIDEAN_ALGORITHMS.c to exist.
